.env*
!.env.example
scripts/dev
template/node_modules
template/.next
template/test-results
template/playwright-report
.data
scripts/.tmp*
# Anchored to the repo's root: lib/native is runtime code that lib/env.ts imports. template-native/ stays in the upload,
# since a kept test imports its bridge and a deployment's typecheck reads tests too.
/native
/docs/spikes
# The build log's screenshots: docs/BUILD_LOG.md itself stays.
/docs/log
# Muse Privacy runs on the person's own device and its relay on Cloudflare, so none of it ships with the site.
/privacy
# Muse Muse root measurements page: docs only, no site code reads it.
/eval
